:: 시작 [title menu nobr]
<section class="title-screen">
  <div class="title-screen__shade"></div>
  <div class="title-screen__content">
    <p class="title-kicker">AFTER THE CLOSING BELL</p>
    <h1>폐장 후, 우리</h1>
    <p class="title-copy">시장은 닫혔지만<br>끝내 정리하지 못한 관계는 그제야 움직이기 시작했다.</p>
    <nav class="title-menu" aria-label="시작 메뉴">
      <button type="button" class="title-menu__primary" data-vn-passage="프롤로그 · 폐장">새 게임</button>
      <<if Save.browser && Save.browser.size > 0>>
        <button type="button" data-vn-action="continue">이어하기</button>
      <<else>>
        <button type="button" disabled>이어하기</button>
      <</if>>
      <button type="button" data-vn-action="saves">불러오기</button>
    </nav>
  </div>
  <p class="title-version">CHAPTER 2 · 0.4</p>
</section>
